From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Koval <kovalidis@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:05:34 +0200
Subject: Replace ntp with chrony

ntpd needs about 25 s to step the clock when it starts before the
network is up. chronyd can be told to resolve and poll its servers
right away with "chronyc online" once there is a DHCP lease.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
index 804d1281..58c03e42 100644
--- a/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rockchip_rk3506_luckfox_defconfig
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 #include "lvgl/lvgl_rkadk.config"
 #include "fs/ubifs.config"
 BR2_PACKAGE_CAN_UTILS=y
+BR2_PACKAGE_CHRONY=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_DIALOG=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_DNSMASQ=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_DTC=y
@@ -37,7 +38,6 @@ BR2_PACKAGE_NANOCOM=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_NFTABLES=y
 # BR2_PACKAGE_NFTABLES_PYTHON is not set
 BR2_PACKAGE_NMAP=y
-BR2_PACKAGE_NTP=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSH=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSH_GEN_KEYS=y
 BR2_PACKAGE_PCRE2_16=y
